  "item_short_desc": "<p>Step into service-compliant excellence with Rothco's AR 670-1 Coyote Brown Forced Entry Boot. Designed to meet field standards, this boot ensures top-tier performance.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2020",
  "description": "<p>Step into service-compliant excellence with Rothco's AR 670-1 Coyote Brown Forced Entry Boot. Designed to meet field standards, this boot ensures top-tier performance. With an 8-inch height measured from the ground at the back center, it combines optimal support with service precision. The upper is crafted from flesh side out cattle hide leather (nubuck) with durable nylon, providing a robust and reliable construction. The rubber outsole, matching the upper in color, offers superior traction and durability. The plain toe design adds a classic touch to the tactical boot. The Cambrelle synthetic lining, without mesh, enhances comfort and moisture control. The soles measure 1.75 inches in height, and double side vents contribute to breathable comfort, making it ideal for various demanding situations. Additionally, the padded collar provides extra support, ensuring a comfortable fit throughout your missions. Elevate your gear with Rothco's AR 670-1 Coyote Brown Forced Entry Boot. Designed with precision and built to withstand the harshest conditions, Rothco's collection of footwear and accessories combines durability, functionality, and unparalleled performance. From our Forced Entry Series which features our speedlace and waterproof technologies, to our V-Max Collection designed with lightweight running shoe soles, our diverse range of footwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, Rothco is the go-to brand for all things that keep you standing on your feet.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
